{"topicCode":"M12103","details":"<h1 class=\"study-h1\">單元三：人工智慧 (AI) 與機器視覺檢測</h1>\n<figure class=\"unit-visual\">\n  <img src=\"assets/learning-units/09_人工智慧AI與機器視覺檢測_3D.png\" alt=\"人工智慧與機器視覺 3D 圖解：AOI、瑕疵分類與預測維護\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption><span class=\"unit-visual__eyebrow\">3D 單元總覽</span><strong>圖解重點：</strong>光源、鏡頭、工業相機與瑕疵分流表現 AOI 與 AI 分類；馬達振動頻譜、風險曲線與維護路徑，連結 PdM、P-F 間隔與漏檢/過檢風險。</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">1. 人工智慧在製造領域的學習範式</h2>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">人工智慧（Artificial Intelligence, AI）在智慧製造中主要用於缺陷檢測、製程參數最佳化與設備故障預測。</p>\n<div class=\"mermaid-block\"><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-src=\"assets/diagrams/4390ac0af33c1e88.svg\">flowchart TD\n  AI[\"工業人工智慧 (Industrial AI)\"]\n  AI --&gt; SL[\"監督式學習 (Supervised Learning)<br>(輸入有標籤數據 Label)\"]\n  AI --&gt; SSL[\"半監督式學習 (Semi-supervised Learning)<br>(少量標籤 + 大量未標籤數據)\"]\n  AI --&gt; UL[\"非監督式學習 (Unsupervised Learning)<br>(輸入無標籤數據 Unlabeled)\"]\n  AI --&gt; RL[\"強化學習 (Reinforcement Learning)<br>(透過環境獎勵機制學習)\"]\n\n  SL --&gt; SL1[\"瑕疵分類 (ResNet/VGG)<br>品質指標迴歸預測\"]\n  SSL --&gt; SSL1[\"少量已標記瑕疵影像<br>搭配大量未標記影像\"]\n  UL --&gt; UL1[\"異常偵測 (Autoencoder / PCA)<br>客群分群 (K-Means)\"]\n  RL --&gt; RL1[\"機械手臂無碰撞路徑規劃<br>加熱爐動態節能控制\"]</pre></div>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">監督式學習（Supervised Learning）</strong>：利用輸入與已知目標值訓練；目標是瑕疵類別時為分類，目標是連續的尺寸、溫度或壽命數值時為迴歸。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">半監督式學習（Semi-supervised Learning）</strong>：以少量已標註資料搭配大量未標註資料訓練，適用於瑕疵標註成本高、但可取得大量產線影像的情境。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">非監督式學習（Unsupervised Learning）</strong>：在工廠良品率達 99.9% 時，不良品樣本極度稀缺（資料不平衡 Data Imbalance），可利用自動編碼器（Autoencoder）以大量「正常良品數據」訓練特徵重構模型。當重構誤差（Reconstruction Error）高於閥值時即判定為異常。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">2. 自動光學檢測 (AOI) 與深度學習</h2>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">自動光學檢測（Automated Optical Inspection, AOI）結合光學成像、精密機械平台與影像處理演算法，協助檢測或在經驗證的任務範圍內取代部分人工目檢；不確定案例仍需安排複判。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(1) 光學硬體架構選型</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">工業相機選型</strong>：</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">面陣相機（Area Scan Camera）</strong>：一次曝光擷取矩形二維畫面，適用於靜態或步進式拍照（如 PCB 基板點檢）。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">線陣相機（Line Scan Camera）</strong>：一次僅擷取一條像素線，配合旋轉或連續平移機構連續曝光合成超高解析度長條圖，適用於滾筒鋼板、紡織品、連續卷軸（Roll-to-Roll）檢測。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">光源照明技巧</strong>：</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">同軸光（Coaxial Light）</strong>：光線經分光鏡沿鏡頭軸線照射工件，可利用平整反射面與缺陷的反射差異形成對比；是否適合劃痕檢測須以材質、角度及缺陷樣本試拍確認。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">背光源（Backlight）</strong>：自物體背後打光形成剪影，凸顯外輪廓邊緣，適合量測零件外徑尺寸與孔徑。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">低角度環形光（Low-Angle Ring Light）</strong>：側向低角度照射，強化表面浮雕文字、雷雕條碼與微小凹陷陰影。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(2) 傳統機器視覺 vs 深度學習視覺</h3>\n<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>比較構面</th><th>傳統規則型機器視覺 (Rule-Based Vision)</th><th>深度學習機器視覺 (Deep Learning / CNN)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">主要演算法</strong></td><td>邊緣檢測（Sobel/Canny）、二值化門檻（Otsu）、樣板匹配（Template Matching）</td><td>卷積神經網路（CNN）、YOLO 物件偵測、U-Net 語意分割</td></tr><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">適用任務</strong></td><td>精確幾何尺寸量測（公差 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$\\pm 0.01\\text{ mm}$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mtext>&nbsp;mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 0.01\\text{ mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、定位引導</td><td>複雜紋理背景下的微小刮傷、污漬、崩角與裂紋分類</td></tr><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">適應力</strong></td><td>依規則與成像穩定性而定，需驗證光照及表面變異</td><td>可從代表性樣本學習變異，但對未涵蓋的光照、材質或形變仍可能失效</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(3) 品質檢測關鍵考核指標</h3>\n<div class=\"mermaid-block\"><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-src=\"assets/diagrams/11803070054b972e.svg\">flowchart LR\n  subgraph \"實體真實狀態 (Ground Truth)\"\n    DEFECT[\"瑕疵品 (Defect)\"]\n    GOOD[\"良品 (Good)\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph \"AOI 系統判斷結果\"\n    PRED_DEFECT[\"判定為瑕疵\"]\n    PRED_GOOD[\"判定為良品\"]\n  end\n\n  DEFECT --&gt; |正確檢出| PRED_DEFECT\n  DEFECT -. \"❌ 漏判 (Underkill / FN)<br>致命客訴風險！\" .-&gt; PRED_GOOD\n\n  GOOD --&gt; |正確放行| PRED_GOOD\n  GOOD -. \"⚠️ 過殺 (Overkill / FP)<br>增加人工覆檢工時\" .-&gt; PRED_DEFECT</pre></div>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">漏檢（Underkill / False Negative, FN）</strong>：將不良品誤判為良品，可能導致客訴與外部失敗成本；應依缺陷嚴重度訂定驗收標準，高風險缺陷需搭配複核或其他防錯措施。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">過檢（Overkill / False Positive, FP / 誤殺）</strong>：將合格良品誤判為瑕疵品。過檢率過高會導致重檢（Re-check）工時暴增與不必要的報廢返修成本。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">3. 預測性維護 (PdM) 與振動頻譜分析</h2>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">預測性維護（Predictive Maintenance, PdM）依託實體狀態監測（Condition Monitoring），在設備即將失效前執行精準維護。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(1) P-F 間隔曲線 (P-F Interval)</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">P-F 曲線描述設備從「潛伏故障可偵測點（Potential Failure, P）」到「功能性喪失停機點（Functional Failure, F）」的退化歷程：</p>\n<div class=\"mermaid-block\"><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-src=\"assets/diagrams/be226f1acfa485f8.svg\">flowchart LR\n  P[\"P 點：潛伏故障發生<br>(微弱超音波、高頻微震)\"] --&gt; VIB[\"振動異常特徵顯現<br>(FFT 諧波出現)\"]\n  VIB --&gt; TEMP[\"溫度顯著升高<br>(熱阻上升、潤滑失效)\"]\n  TEMP --&gt; NOISE[\"人耳可聽噪音與煙霧\"]\n  NOISE --&gt; F[\"F 點：功能完全喪失<br>(卡死、斷軸、全線停工)\"]</pre></div>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">PdM 的目的即是在 P 點與振動顯現期及早介入，將「非計畫性突發停機」轉化為「計畫性利用換班時間維修」。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(2) 旋轉機械振動頻譜分析基礎</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">透過快速傅立葉變換（FFT）將時域訊號轉換為頻域頻譜圖，對應轉軸轉速基頻（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$1\\times\\text{RPM}$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>RPM</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times\\text{RPM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RPM</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">轉子不平衡（Unbalance）</strong>：頻譜在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$1\\times$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 轉速基頻處出現極高振幅峰值。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">軸承對心不良（Misalignment）</strong>：頻譜在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$2\\times$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 諧波處出現顯著峰值，並伴隨軸向振動過大。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">滾動軸承（Rolling Element Bearing）損傷</strong>：依據幾何結構產生特定軸承缺陷特徵頻率：</li>\n<li>外環通過頻率（Ball Pass Frequency Outer Race, BPFO）</li>\n<li>內環通過頻率（Ball Pass Frequency Inner Race, BPFI）</li>\n<li>滾動體自轉頻率（Ball Spin Frequency, BSF）</li>\n<li>保持架旋轉頻率（Fundamental Train Frequency, FTF）</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">深度研讀：把分類分數轉為可執行的品質決策</h2>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">1. 正類、分母與決策門檻必須先約定</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">以下以「瑕疵」為正類：TP 是檢出的瑕疵、FN 是漏掉的瑕疵、FP 是被誤攔截的良品、TN 是正確放行的良品。召回率 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$TP÷(TP+FN)$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>÷</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP÷(TP+FN)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">TP</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">TP</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">FN</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 回答瑕疵找回多少；精確率 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$TP÷(TP+FP)$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>÷</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP÷(TP+FP)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">TP</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">TP</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">FP</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 回答攔截品中有多少真的不良；準確率 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$(TP+TN)÷N$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>÷</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(TP+TN)÷N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">TP</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">TN</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 則容易被大量良品主導。若把正類改成良品，指標名稱不變但現場含義改變，報表須明確標示。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">模型輸出的分數不必然是校準後的瑕疵機率。調整門檻會改變攔截數，卻不會修補漏標、影像模糊或訓練資料缺少某種缺陷的問題。門檻選擇須同時看漏檢代價、複判能力及各缺陷類別；若一個總體門檻掩蓋少見但嚴重的缺陷，應分層分析。門檻應在驗證資料上選擇，再用未參與選擇的測試資料估計效果，不能反覆看測試分數直到挑出最好結果。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">2. 整合案例：最便宜的門檻為何未必可上線</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">假設與輸入：</strong>獨立驗證批次有 5,000 件，經可靠複判確認 100 件瑕疵、4,900 件良品；分數越高越像瑕疵。每漏檢一件的平均損失假設為 500 成本單位，每誤攔截一件良品為 3 單位，其他共同成本暫不計。所有被攔截品均須人工確認，一班最多處理 200 件。</p>\n<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>門檻</th><th>TP</th><th>FN</th><th>FP</th><th>TN</th><th>待複判數</th><th>估算差異成本</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0.80</td><td>80</td><td>20</td><td>25</td><td>4,875</td><td>105</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$20×500+25×3=10,075$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>075</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20×500+25×3=10,075</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">075</span></span></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td>0.65</td><td>92</td><td>8</td><td>75</td><td>4,825</td><td>167</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$8×500+75×3=4,225$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>225</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8×500+75×3=4,225</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">225</span></span></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td>0.50</td><td>96</td><td>4</td><td>140</td><td>4,760</td><td>236</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$4×500+140×3=2,420$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>140</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>420</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4×500+140×3=2,420</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">420</span></span></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">0.80 的準確率為 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$(80+4,875)÷5,000=99.1\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>875</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>÷</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>99.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(80+4,875)÷5,000=99.1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">875</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.1%</span></span></span></span></span>，召回率卻僅 80%；0.50 的準確率降為 97.12%，召回率提高到 96%，精確率則為 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$96÷236≈40.68\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>96</mn><mo>÷</mo><mn>236</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>40.68</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">96÷236≈40.68\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">96</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">236</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40.68%</span></span></span></span></span>。因此只挑最高準確率會選錯風險方向。成本最低的 0.50 需要複判 236 件，超過本案例 200 件容量；在這三個候選中，0.65 是成本較低且符合容量的方案，但不代表已找到所有可能門檻中的全域最優值。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">決策：</strong>先確認 8 件漏檢的缺陷種類與客戶要求是否容許，再決定採用 0.65、增加複判產能，或對特定缺陷加入第二種檢測。不能以「平均成本較低」直接放行不符合品質要求的產品。若漏檢成本或瑕疵比例改變，也需重算；這些成本是假設輸入，並非固定業界標準。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">驗證：</strong>以不同日期、原料批次與光源條件的保留測試集確認結果，並在上線初期保留人工抽驗。記錄模型、門檻、相機設定與複判結果，按缺陷類別追蹤 FN／FP 及積壓量。觀察到漏檢時先查成像、標註與製程條件，再決定重訓或調門檻。只比較整體準確率，可能看不見某一類缺陷已完全失效。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">3. 資料分割與漂移判讀的反例</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">同一工件連拍十張照片，應視為同一群組，避免相近影像分散到訓練與測試。若要估計未來月份效果，還要考慮按時間切分；若目標是新設備，測試應涵蓋未見設備。資料標準化、特徵選擇及門檻調整都應只使用適當訓練／驗證資料，避免把測試答案間接帶入。可參考 <a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/cross_validation.html\" class=\"study-link\">scikit-learn 官方交叉驗證與群組切分說明</a>。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">分數分布改變可能來自光源老化，也可能是產品真的變差；未取得真實標籤前，不能僅憑分數位移判定模型失效。另一方面，分數分布看似相同也不代表召回率不變。漂移監控應結合輸入影像品質、製程變更、抽驗標籤與分層指標，而非只設一條平均分數警戒線。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">門檻與模型也應分開版本管理：同一模型改門檻，攔截量就可能大幅改變，因此不能只保存模型檔。比較新舊方案時固定測試資料、真實標籤與成本假設，再記錄差異；若新方案只在光源良好的白班改善，夜班漏檢卻增加，不能用合併平均掩蓋。上線後累積的新標籤可用於後續訓練，但應另保留未使用的驗證批次，避免每次更新都使用同一套「熟悉的考卷」。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">4. 進階練習與解析</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">練習一：</strong>測試 2,000 件，真實瑕疵 60 件；系統檢出 54 件瑕疵並誤攔 18 件良品。求 FN、TN、召回率、精確率與準確率。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">解析：</strong>FN＝<span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$60-54=6$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60-54=6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">54</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>，真實良品 1,940 件，TN＝<span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$1,940-18=1,922$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>940</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>922</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,940-18=1,922</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">940</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">922</span></span></span></span></span>。召回率＝<span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$54÷60=90\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>54</mn><mo>÷</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">54÷60=90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">54</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>；精確率＝<span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$54÷72=75\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>54</mn><mo>÷</mo><mn>72</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">54÷72=75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">54</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span></span></span></span></span>；準確率＝<span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$(54+1,922)÷2,000=98.8\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>922</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>÷</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>98.8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(54+1,922)÷2,000=98.8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">54</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">922</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">98.8%</span></span></span></span></span>。98.8% 不能掩蓋仍有 10% 瑕疵漏檢，且這只是該測試樣本的估計。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">練習二：</strong>同一資料集的門檻 X 有 FN＝12、FP＝20；門檻 Y 有 FN＝5、FP＝120。每件誤攔成本為 2，其他條件相同，漏檢成本超過多少時，Y 的差異成本較低？</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">解析：</strong>設每件漏檢成本為 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$c$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，比較 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$5c+120×2&lt;12c+20×2$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5c+120×2&lt;12c+20×2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$c&gt;200÷7≈28.57$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>÷</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>28.57</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c&gt;200÷7≈28.57</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28.57</span></span></span></span></span>。等於此值時兩者成本相同；仍需另外核對複判容量與缺陷風險，成本不等式不能取代可行性檢查。</p>\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">職能基準對照與實務解說</h2>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">核心內容：先辨識學習目標，再檢查資料與成像條件</h3>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">對應考題核心</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">從考查核心回想本章觀念；點選題號可閱讀本題說明。</p>\n<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">對應考題</th><th scope=\"col\">考查核心</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr id=\"exam-core-L12-13\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L12-13\" data-material=\"M12103\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L12-13\">L12 第 13 題</a></td><td>工業相機介面的概括線長排序</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L12-23\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L12-23\" data-material=\"M12103\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L12-23\">L12 第 23 題</a></td><td>迴歸的監督式學習與過度擬合</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L12-24\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L12-24\" data-material=\"M12103\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L12-24\">L12 第 24 題</a></td><td>強化學習的獎勵函數</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L12-25\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L12-25\" data-material=\"M12103\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L12-25\">L12 第 25 題</a></td><td>本地訓練前提下的網路影響</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L12-27\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L12-27\" data-material=\"M12103\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L12-27\">L12 第 27 題</a></td><td>電腦視覺的場景理解目的</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L12-32\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L12-32\" data-material=\"M12103\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L12-32\">L12 第 32 題</a></td><td>決策樹可使用多個輸入特徵</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">進階延伸：模型指標必須連到現場成本</h2>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">建立可用的訓練資料</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">影像或感測資料需依產品型號、設備、批次、光源、班別與缺陷類別保留來源；標註規範要定義缺陷邊界、嚴重度與不確定案例的處置。訓練、驗證與測試資料應避免同一批次或近似影像洩漏到不同集合，否則測試表現可能過度樂觀。新產品、新材料、鏡頭更換或環境照明改變，都可能造成資料分布漂移。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">混淆矩陣與門檻選擇</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">在瑕疵檢測中，漏檢（False Negative）可能讓缺陷流到客戶，過檢（False Positive）則增加人工複判與停線成本。準確率在良品遠多於不良品時容易掩蓋漏檢，因此應同時看召回率、精確率、每件複判時間、漏檢成本與不同缺陷類別表現。判定門檻應依風險設定；高風險缺陷可採較高召回並搭配二次確認。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">從模型輸出到品質閉環</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">推論結果應保留模型版本、信心分數、相機／光源設定、產品序號與後續人工判定。低信心樣本可導向人工複核；若模型持續誤判某類產品，先確認資料與設備條件，再評估重新標註與再訓練。模型更新需經離線評估、影子測試或小批量驗證，並準備回退版本，不能未驗證即替換量產判定。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">PdM 的維護決策</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">預測性維護要比較預警提前量、誤報率、漏報率及維護成本。感測器異常或工況改變可能造成虛假告警；將模型輸出直接轉成停機命令也可能帶來額外損失。實務上以維修工單閉環：告警、確認、檢修、故障模式記錄、模型結果回饋，逐步驗證預測是否能改善可用率。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">自我檢核</h3>\n<ol class=\"study-ordered-list\">\n<li>瑕疵比例僅 0.2%，模型準確率 99.8% 是否足以證明可上線？</li>\n<li>換新光源後漏檢增加，應先考慮模型本身或資料／成像條件？</li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">判讀要點：</strong>不能只看準確率，須看少數類別召回率、成本與代表性測試；光源改變會造成成像分布漂移，需先確認影像條件與資料品質。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">深度應用：從混淆矩陣看 AOI 漏判與過殺</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">假設抽驗 1,000 件，其中真實瑕疵 50 件；AOI 判為瑕疵 70 件，其中 40 件確為瑕疵、30 件是良品，另有 10 件瑕疵被判為良品。此時召回率（Recall）為 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$40 ÷ (40+10)=80\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>÷</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40 ÷ (40+10)=80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>，代表瑕疵中仍有 20% 漏判；精確率（Precision）為 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$40 ÷ (40+30)≈57.1\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>÷</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>57.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40 ÷ (40+30)≈57.1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">57.1%</span></span></span></span></span>，代表被攔截品中有相當比例需要複判。調降判定門檻通常會提高召回率，但也可能增加過殺；量產前應依漏判與複判成本設定門檻並以代表性批次驗證。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">延伸應用：把 PdM 訊號變成維護行動</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">振動 RMS 上升是狀態訊號，不是單獨的故障結論。需比對轉速、負載、感測器安裝位置、頻譜特徵與歷史基線，排除換產品、換治具或感測器鬆動等原因；確認劣化趨勢後，再建立檢查／維修工單、安排可用停機時段，並於維修後確認指標回到可接受範圍。模型或警報只提出風險線索，仍需依現場安全與設備維護程序判斷。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">本章對應 <strong class=\"study-strong\">T2.7 蒐集／分析智慧製造數據、落實精實管理與節能減碳</strong>。AI 或 AOI 結果應結合現場脈絡、標註品質與驗證資料判讀，再提出可執行的預防或改善措施；模型輸出是決策證據的一部分，不能取代品質、安全或維護程序。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">職能任務：由資料分析提出可落實改善</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">T2.7 的 P2.7.1 至 P2.7.3 要求蒐集與運用生產數據、提出改善方案並落實成效。因此 AOI 或預測模型的交付不應只是一個準確率數字，而要能連結產品、批次、設備、時間、影像或感測特徵，以及實際的品質／維護結果。這能支持 K17 巨量資料蒐集方法、S14 分析、S18 資訊科技應用與 S21 製程改善建議。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">AI 導入應以明確問題開始，例如降低特定瑕疵漏檢、提早辨識軸承劣化或縮短異常判讀時間。接著定義可接受的錯誤型態與成本、蒐集代表性資料、建立一致標註規則、分離訓練與驗證資料，並在產品、照明、材料或製程改變時重新評估。模型上線後也要監測資料漂移與處置結果。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">從判定到現場行動</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">若 AOI 產生不良判定，系統應有清楚的隔離、複核、返工或升級流程；若 PdM 顯示劣化，應結合趨勢、現場檢查與維護工單決定處置。模型若直接取代品質放行或安全決策，卻沒有驗證、監控與人工升級機制，便超出其可被信任的範圍。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">常見誤區</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li>只用單一準確率評價模型，未看漏檢、誤殺及其現場成本。</li>\n<li>因訓練資料表現良好就直接上線，未以新批次、不同照明或不同設備資料驗證。</li>\n<li>把 AI 異常訊號視為根因，未回到設備、材料、方法與品質事實確認。</li>\n</ul>","questions":{"L12-13":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">先辨識題目比較的是「連接線長度」，公告排序為 GigE → Camera Link → USB 3.0。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">再檢查工程應用有無指定線材或延伸方案。</p></section><section class=\"question-mistakes\"><h3>常見誤選理由</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">以頻寬排名代替距離排名，或把題內排序誤寫成所有型號均適用的固定公尺數。</p></section>\n<section class=\"question-check\"><h3>結果檢核</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">公告依典型連線距離選 GigE、Camera Link、USB 3.0。比較項目是距離而非頻寬；實際長度須查版本、模式、線材及主動延伸方案。</p></section>","note":"公告採 GigE、Camera Link、USB 3.0；線材、模式、版本及延伸方案影響實際距離，非固定線長定律。","noteIds":["73e0de759c9b42bf","d9e0756895300234","83ffa8171e64de5b","e736f971c9b5b81a"]},"L12-23":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">反向題：以已知目標數值配對輸入來擬合，是監督式迴歸。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">最小平方法可用於線性迴歸，參數過多也可能過度擬合。</p></section><section class=\"question-mistakes\"><h3>常見誤選理由</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">誤以為監督式只能輸出類別。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">另須區分關聯與因果，迴歸關係本身不證明改變某參數必然造成品質變化。</p></section>\n<section class=\"question-check\"><h3>結果檢核</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">有目標數值供學習的迴歸屬監督式，故 A 錯。模型過複雜可能過擬合，最小平方可擬合線性模型；相關或迴歸仍不直接證明因果。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["73e0de759c9b42bf","d9e0756895300234","83ffa8171e64de5b"]},"L12-24":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">強化學習依行動後的獎勵學習策略，因此須定義獎勵訊號／函數。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">製造任務還應限制碰撞、超溫及品質風險。</p></section><section class=\"question-mistakes\"><h3>常見誤選理由</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">將分類模型需要大量人工標籤的流程套到強化學習，或以固定規則列盡所有情境，忽略互動學習。</p></section>\n<section class=\"question-check\"><h3>結果檢核</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">強化學習由互動獎勵引導策略，因此需定義獎勵訊號。人工逐筆類別標註不是其共同必要條件，固定規則也不必預先涵蓋所有情境。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["73e0de759c9b42bf","d9e0756895300234","83ffa8171e64de5b"]},"L12-25":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">先保留「資料與運算都在本地」前提，再比較模型泛化問題與外部連線問題。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">此時網路穩定性通常不直接改變預測準確性。</p></section><section class=\"question-mistakes\"><h3>常見誤選理由</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">漏讀本地前提，套用雲端取數中斷的情境。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">資料偏差、洩漏及過度擬合則確實會使結果失真。</p></section>\n<section class=\"question-check\"><h3>結果檢核</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">以資料與運算均在本地且不依賴遠端取數為前提，網路穩定性通常不直接改變準確率。洩漏、偏差與過擬合會使評估或泛化失真。</p></section>","note":"以資料與運算在本地、無需遠端取數為前提；雲端訓練或線上取數須重判。","noteIds":["73e0de759c9b42bf","d9e0756895300234","83ffa8171e64de5b","065ee51b3ab60079"]},"L12-27":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">視覺的任務目的是從影像取得可用的場景理解，如物件、位置與關係。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">像素或顏色統計只是中間處理。</p></section><section class=\"question-mistakes\"><h3>常見誤選理由</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">把容易量測的像素數當最終目的，或把影像轉文字這一項應用當作全部電腦視覺的定義。</p></section>\n<section class=\"question-check\"><h3>結果檢核</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">電腦視覺從影像取得場景理解，像素、顏色與文字描述是部分處理或任務。並非每套視覺系統都必須完成三維重建才能成立。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["73e0de759c9b42bf","d9e0756895300234","83ffa8171e64de5b"]},"L12-32":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">反向題：整棵樹可以依不同節點使用多個特徵。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">例如先判斷溫度，再判斷振動。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">單一節點測一個特徵，不等於整棵樹只能輸入一維資料。</p></section><section class=\"question-mistakes\"><h3>常見誤選理由</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">將節點的單一條件誤推成模型的單一維度。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">「容易理解」也不表示深樹永遠簡單或訓練耗時固定。</p></section>\n<section class=\"question-check\"><h3>結果檢核</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">節點可依不同特徵逐層判斷，整棵樹不限一維。樹深、資料量及實作影響計算量，不能把其他選項的易讀、快速當成無條件保證。</p></section>","note":"單節點測一特徵不等於整棵樹只能處理一維；耗時及可解釋性仍受資料量、樹深與演算法影響。","noteIds":["73e0de759c9b42bf","d9e0756895300234","83ffa8171e64de5b"]}},"notes":{"73e0de759c9b42bf":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">工程核對來源：</strong><a href=\"https://www.baslerweb.com/en-us/learning/data-transmission-usb-3-0/\" class=\"study-link\">Basler USB 3.0 傳輸說明</a> 說明被動、主動及光纖方案的距離差異；其例子也顯示 USB 並非一律限於 3 公尺。<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/tree.html\" class=\"study-link\">scikit-learn 決策樹文件</a> 提供多特徵分類範例及過度擬合限制。這些資料用於限定技術適用條件，不更動公告答案。</p>","materialCode":"M12103","heading":"試題判讀與選項辨析：學習方式與視覺任務"},"d9e0756895300234":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">原創小題：</strong>把同一工件的連續近似影像隨機分到訓練與測試集，測試分數很高，能否證明跨批次有效？<strong class=\"study-strong\">答案：不能。</strong>近似樣本洩漏可能高估效果，應以獨立工件或批次切分，再確認新班別、產品與照明條件下的表現。</p>","materialCode":"M12103","heading":"試題判讀與選項辨析：學習方式與視覺任務"},"83ffa8171e64de5b":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">對應 115 年第一次 L12 公告試題第 13、23～25、27、32 題。</strong>有已知目標數值的迴歸屬監督式學習；不能因輸出不是類別就誤判成非監督式。線性迴歸可用最小平方法擬合，但加入過多參數可能擬合到訓練雜訊。決策樹可依溫度、壓力、振動等多個特徵逐節點分支，並非只能使用單一維度。強化學習則需要獎勵函數引導行動；獎勵若只鼓勵產量、未限制品質與風險，可能學到不適合現場採用的策略。</p>","materialCode":"M12103","heading":"試題導向：先辨識學習目標，再檢查資料與成像條件"},"065ee51b3ab60079":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\">資料偏差、過度擬合與資料洩漏都會破壞模型對新資料的可信度。第 25 題特別限定「本地電腦訓練」：當資料及運算均在本地、無需連線取數時，網路穩定性通常不直接改變模型準確性；若改成雲端訓練或遠端資料來源，則須重新判讀條件。電腦視覺的目的在於理解景物與任務資訊，像素數量、顏色分布只是可使用的特徵或中間步驟。</p>","materialCode":"M12103","heading":"試題導向：先辨識學習目標，再檢查資料與成像條件"},"e736f971c9b5b81a":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\">相機介面亦屬本章的硬體基礎：第 13 題公告答案採線長由長到短為 <strong class=\"study-strong\">GigE、Camera Link、USB 3.0</strong>。這是題內的概括比較，並非三種介面各有不變的最大線長；延伸器、主動／光纖線材、傳輸模式與特定產品規格都會改變可用距離。選型需同時核對解析度、幀率、觸發同步、頻寬及線長。</p>","materialCode":"M12103","heading":"試題導向：先辨識學習目標，再檢查資料與成像條件"}}}
